WEBVTT

00:03.980 --> 00:05.330
That was incredible!

00:05.330 --> 00:06.940
That's our Holy Saint!

00:11.520 --> 00:13.290
Though the swamp has been purified,

00:13.290 --> 00:14.910
we need to continue monitoring it.

00:15.410 --> 00:19.400
I'd like us to stay here for a few days 
to confirm the decrease in monsters.

00:19.400 --> 00:22.630
Wolff, take our unit to patrol the area.

00:23.100 --> 00:24.220
Yes, sir!

00:24.220 --> 00:26.840
In that case, I'll join them.

00:26.840 --> 00:29.180
I'd be much obliged for your help.

00:29.540 --> 00:30.890
It's nothing.

00:35.700 --> 00:37.520
Um, what about me?

00:38.820 --> 00:40.260
You'll stay with me.

00:40.690 --> 00:41.940
U-Um...

00:42.680 --> 00:46.750
I don't want to be too far from you 
after what happened.

00:46.750 --> 00:48.530
I couldn't stand it.

00:51.030 --> 00:55.370
<i>My heart can't stand </i>you<i> saying </i>that<i>!</i>

02:26.000 --> 02:29.000
"Longing"

02:35.330 --> 02:37.100
<i>At the same time...</i>

02:37.100 --> 02:39.510
<i>I feel bad waiting around doing nothing.</i>

02:48.840 --> 02:52.270
One last survey of the plants in the area?

02:52.600 --> 02:54.860
You really are enamored with your work.

02:55.350 --> 02:59.690
Well, I <i>am</i> a researcher at the 
Medicinal Flora Research Institute.

02:59.690 --> 03:00.830
Sorry.

03:01.360 --> 03:04.000
No, I don't mind at all.

03:04.000 --> 03:07.420
Fret not. It is my duty to protect you.

03:07.980 --> 03:12.550
Even if it's your duty, 
I still feel bad about it...

03:10.970 --> 03:13.380
Apologies. I did not choose my words well.

03:13.800 --> 03:16.070
It is not strictly about duty...

03:16.070 --> 03:18.970
I just want to be by your side.

03:19.310 --> 03:21.180
I-I see...

03:23.140 --> 03:25.900
O-Oh! Lilac!

03:32.640 --> 03:34.680
Is it a rare flower?

03:34.680 --> 03:39.060
Somewhat. It usually blooms 
when it's a little warmer.

03:39.060 --> 03:39.820
I see.

03:43.250 --> 03:44.980
It has a very pleasing scent.

03:45.750 --> 03:46.930
Right?

03:46.930 --> 03:50.180
They say lilac has a relaxing effect.

03:50.180 --> 03:51.710
In the language of flowers, it means—

03:56.230 --> 03:57.090
What's wrong?

03:57.620 --> 03:59.890
O-Oh, nothing! P-P-Perfume!

03:59.890 --> 04:02.110
Yes, it's great to use as perfume!

04:02.110 --> 04:04.770
Perfume? That sounds nice.

04:05.100 --> 04:07.730
The smell is indeed very calming.

04:10.710 --> 04:12.650
<i>He wants to be by my side?</i>

04:13.330 --> 04:15.280
<i>But what do </i>I<i> want?</i>

04:16.290 --> 04:22.570
<i>I guess it'd be nice to get 
a teeny-tiny bit closer to him...</i>

04:23.180 --> 04:28.540
Um, if it's all right with you, 
could I make some for you as a present?

04:33.840 --> 04:35.300
I can't wait.

04:41.700 --> 04:42.760
Commander!

04:44.560 --> 04:46.360
I'm here to report.

04:46.680 --> 04:49.370
We've completed
 the designated monitoring period.

04:49.370 --> 04:52.270
There have been no new
 monster sightings in that time.

04:52.270 --> 04:54.730
I see. Excellent work.

04:55.090 --> 04:57.110
Then we shall prepare to withdraw.

04:57.110 --> 04:59.160
Pass the order down to all units.

04:59.160 --> 05:00.450
Understood!

05:05.730 --> 05:07.800
Welcome back.

05:07.800 --> 05:09.620
We've returned safely.

05:10.130 --> 05:11.010
Please.

05:14.740 --> 05:17.460
You must be tired from all 
the travel on your mission.

05:17.840 --> 05:20.200
We've prepared your rooms.

05:20.200 --> 05:22.800
Please take your time recovering.

05:23.160 --> 05:24.800
Thank you very much.

05:24.800 --> 05:29.120
We have arranged for a simple 
banquet this evening.

05:29.120 --> 05:31.270
You can look forward to it.

05:31.270 --> 05:34.050
Do you mean our customary one?

05:34.050 --> 05:35.230
Yes, that's right.

05:35.230 --> 05:37.190
A customary banquet?

05:37.630 --> 05:41.740
The Hawke Domain always hosts 
a banquet after a subjugation.

05:41.740 --> 05:44.000
Since it's to thank our troops,

05:44.000 --> 05:47.500
it's an open party where 
status and rank don't matter.

05:47.910 --> 05:49.160
They don't?

05:49.920 --> 05:51.370
<i>Really?</i>

05:51.950 --> 05:53.110
What's wrong?

05:53.110 --> 05:55.020
It's just that, in my experience,

05:55.020 --> 05:58.340
status isn't wholly disregarded
 at such events.

05:58.680 --> 06:00.090
Don't worry.

06:00.090 --> 06:03.300
It's much more casual 
than a formal dinner party.

06:03.300 --> 06:06.600
The food will be rather simple as well.

06:06.600 --> 06:11.270
We'll serve game hunted in our lands
and dishes featuring our local cheese.

06:11.680 --> 06:14.400
<i>Like cheese fondue or raclette?!</i>

06:15.510 --> 06:16.690
I can't wait to have some!

06:22.260 --> 06:25.070
<i>Sorry. I get greedy when it comes to food.</i>

06:49.010 --> 06:51.680
<i>This really does seem informal.</i>

07:05.500 --> 07:08.040
The food goes quite well with the wine.

07:09.580 --> 07:11.040
I know!

07:11.550 --> 07:13.500
I'm glad you're enjoying everything.

07:13.840 --> 07:18.710
I highly recommend these. 
They're locally-made dried sausages.

07:21.670 --> 07:23.750
<i>It's salami! Salami!</i>

07:23.750 --> 07:25.630
There you go. Please enjoy.

07:26.090 --> 07:27.340
I think I will!

07:43.040 --> 07:44.440
Does it please your palate?

07:47.650 --> 07:49.900
What? O-Oh, yes!

07:49.900 --> 07:51.600
It's really good.

07:52.890 --> 07:55.010
We'll be here for a while longer.

07:55.010 --> 07:56.790
I'll ask them to serve it again.

07:56.790 --> 07:58.080
Thank you so much.

07:58.410 --> 08:02.790
These sausages are sold in the town market.

08:02.790 --> 08:05.300
Why not go see it if you're interested?

08:05.720 --> 08:07.760
Would you like to go, Sei?

08:08.260 --> 08:09.470
Would that be okay?

08:09.470 --> 08:11.530
Everyone is off tomorrow.

08:11.530 --> 08:15.930
You can't go alone,
 but there's no issue if I go with you.

08:15.930 --> 08:18.610
<i>He's coming with me?</i>

08:18.610 --> 08:21.900
<i>So the commander 
will escort me personally?</i>

08:21.900 --> 08:25.020
But doesn't everyone have the day to rest?

08:25.020 --> 08:27.300
You'd be working on your day off.

08:27.300 --> 08:31.700
As the commander, would you be able
 to take a different day of instead?

08:31.700 --> 08:32.860
Not a problem.

08:34.240 --> 08:36.330
Er, wait. That's not right.

08:38.160 --> 08:39.790
<i>He can't, huh?</i>

08:40.260 --> 08:42.380
I want to go with you, Sei.

08:46.020 --> 08:46.960
May I?

08:56.640 --> 08:57.980
I wouldn't say no...

09:11.970 --> 09:13.740
How lively!

09:13.740 --> 09:16.790
This is the largest market in the area.

09:16.790 --> 09:19.580
The shop that sells those 
sausages is farther down.

09:20.140 --> 09:22.790
Let's take our time to look 
at other places on the way.

09:23.300 --> 09:24.250
Sure!

10:00.020 --> 10:01.180
Wow, these are...

10:01.180 --> 10:02.160
What is it?

10:02.160 --> 10:04.030
Aren't these cabbages?

10:04.030 --> 10:06.880
I haven't seen any in the royal capital.

10:06.880 --> 10:09.590
Oh, now that you mention it...

10:10.000 --> 10:12.470
Are you from the capital, young lady?

10:12.470 --> 10:15.030
I can't believe you recognized 'em.

10:15.030 --> 10:18.180
These cabbages are only grown
 around these parts.

10:18.510 --> 10:21.560
Um, I've had them before in the past.

10:21.560 --> 10:23.890
Stuffed cabbage rolls are delicious.

10:24.200 --> 10:25.440
Exactly!

10:25.440 --> 10:28.860
The leaves are really sturdy. 
They're perfect for simmering.

10:29.310 --> 10:32.860
We'd have stuffed cabbage rolls 
at home during winter.

10:32.860 --> 10:34.900
Have you made them before?

10:35.430 --> 10:38.320
No, I've never made them.

10:38.320 --> 10:40.580
Though I think I could if I tried.

10:41.450 --> 10:42.790
I see.

10:45.210 --> 10:46.900
U-Um...

10:47.850 --> 10:48.870
What is it?

10:52.390 --> 10:57.210
I suddenly feel like having stuffed 
cabbage rolls after seeing these.

10:57.210 --> 11:00.430
May I borrow a kitchen to cook some?

11:03.390 --> 11:04.740
I really appreciate it.

11:04.740 --> 11:07.940
No, don't mention it. I wanted some myself.

11:09.150 --> 11:12.650
<i>Yeah, I'd rather see him happy than sad.</i>

11:14.140 --> 11:15.650
What's wrong?

11:15.650 --> 11:22.040
Well, I haven't eaten something new 
you've made before Johan in a long time.

11:22.040 --> 11:23.120
Has it been that long?

11:23.520 --> 11:26.220
The last time was in Klausner's Domain.

11:26.220 --> 11:27.830
Oh, you're right.

11:28.410 --> 11:33.120
Since then, I always hear of your creations
 from Johan's mouth first.

11:33.580 --> 11:36.030
The Japanese cuisine you made
 last time was fascinating, but...

11:36.030 --> 11:38.180
<i>He's kind of cute.</i>

11:47.230 --> 11:48.150
Welcome!

11:48.490 --> 11:52.600
Oh, aren't you the young master
 of the margrave's family?

11:53.130 --> 11:55.070
Thank you very much for coming!

12:00.090 --> 12:03.870
You've finally found a partner? 
Congratulations!

12:03.870 --> 12:06.560
<i>Partner? Congratulations?</i>

12:06.560 --> 12:08.330
<i>Wait! No way!</i>

12:14.370 --> 12:17.720
No, she's someone I work with 
in the royal capital.

12:19.030 --> 12:23.130
Oh my! Sounds like I jumped to conclusions.

12:23.130 --> 12:24.930
I hope I didn't offend.

12:25.980 --> 12:28.000
I'm very sorry, young lady.

12:28.000 --> 12:30.770
It's fine. I don't mind at all.

12:31.160 --> 12:33.010
How kind of you.

12:33.010 --> 12:35.840
So, what are you looking for today?

12:35.840 --> 12:39.320
I heard that you sell dried sausages here.

12:39.320 --> 12:41.160
Oh, if that's what you're after...

12:50.100 --> 12:53.040
And yet my heart is already set.

13:05.330 --> 13:08.310
So these are Lady Takanashi's 
stuffed cabbage rolls?

13:08.660 --> 13:14.020
Yes. They probably don't look much 
different from what you usually eat.

13:14.660 --> 13:17.060
They smell a little sweet.

13:17.060 --> 13:20.030
Yes, but it's something I've smelled before.

13:20.440 --> 13:24.930
I stewed the rolls with bay leaves. 
That's probably what you're smelling.

13:24.930 --> 13:29.250
They say that bay leaves 
can help treat joint pain.

13:29.250 --> 13:34.420
Indeed. It's a medicinal plant 
that also can aid digestion.

13:34.890 --> 13:39.260
That must mean that we can 
eat even more than usual.

13:39.610 --> 13:42.650
That's no reason to overeat.

13:51.120 --> 13:52.850
Oh, goodness me.

13:56.280 --> 13:58.480
<i>This is a little embarrassing!</i>

14:10.450 --> 14:15.080
That reminds me. You'll be staying here
 for a time, won't you, Lady Takanashi?

14:15.080 --> 14:17.090
Yes, that is what I heard.

14:17.560 --> 14:21.420
In that case, why not visit our villa?

14:21.830 --> 14:23.260
Your villa?

14:23.630 --> 14:30.220
Yes. It's in a grove some way from here,
but it's by a lake with stunning scenery.

14:32.640 --> 14:35.150
The villa also has a hot spring.

14:37.300 --> 14:40.340
I heard that the mine
 excursion was hard on you.

14:40.340 --> 14:45.700
I thought you might enjoy relaxing 
in the spring if you had time.

14:47.360 --> 14:48.910
Thank you so much!

15:08.600 --> 15:09.720
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow...

15:09.720 --> 15:10.680
Are you all right?

15:10.680 --> 15:14.810
Oh, I'm fine. Just feeling a bit stiff...

15:15.240 --> 15:16.420
My apologies.

15:16.420 --> 15:20.770
I had them slow down, but the 
carriage is still rocking quite a bit.

15:21.130 --> 15:24.740
N-No, I've gotten used to carriage rides.

15:25.080 --> 15:28.570
<i>I'm just not used to how close 
we're sitting...</i>

15:30.120 --> 15:32.930
It'll be a while yet 
before we reach the villa.

15:32.930 --> 15:34.700
Let's take a break here.

15:40.040 --> 15:41.920
G-Good idea.

15:51.550 --> 15:53.260
Eat up!

15:55.760 --> 15:57.870
Horses are nice.

15:59.610 --> 16:03.440
Does everyone who works at the 
royal palace know how to ride one?

16:03.440 --> 16:05.090
Most folks do, yes.

16:05.550 --> 16:09.260
Almost everyone who aspires to work 
at the palace learns to ride.

16:11.170 --> 16:13.760
<i>Does that mean that not just the director</i>

16:13.760 --> 16:16.250
<i>but even Jude and Aira know how?</i>

16:16.250 --> 16:18.090
<i>Wait, Jude can ride a horse?</i>

16:18.090 --> 16:20.040
<i></i>Jude<i> can? Seriously?</i>

16:20.040 --> 16:22.210
<i>I mean, I don't know how...</i>

16:23.030 --> 16:23.920
Sei?

16:24.380 --> 16:25.680
I'm sorry.

16:25.680 --> 16:29.360
I was just thinking it'd be good 
to learn to ride a horse

16:29.360 --> 16:31.450
since I work at the palace too.

16:31.450 --> 16:37.780
Knowing how to ride a horse is convenient,
although I don't think you'd need to very often.

16:38.370 --> 16:43.020
It'd certainly be useful for traveling 
between the Institute and the palace.

16:43.530 --> 16:48.990
I see. But if you did that, 
I'd have fewer chances to escort you.

16:50.160 --> 16:51.450
That's...

16:56.310 --> 16:57.890
<i>He's teasing me!</i>

16:59.230 --> 17:03.650
Besides, I'm practically part of the military!

17:03.650 --> 17:06.750
I think it would be good to learn riding.

17:07.750 --> 17:10.550
Normal soldiers have to learn it, but...

17:11.420 --> 17:13.880
<i>I see. Holy Saints are special.</i>

17:14.680 --> 17:19.440
You won't be taking part in subjugations
as much going forward anyway.

17:22.850 --> 17:25.190
I guess you're right...

17:25.910 --> 17:28.650
<i>We've purified all the miasma swamps.</i>

17:28.650 --> 17:30.990
<i>Monsters are on the decline now too.</i>

17:30.990 --> 17:35.220
<i>I suppose I won't be seeing 
the commander much anymore...</i>

17:38.370 --> 17:43.640
Nevertheless, it would be nice to go 
on a long ride with you, Sei.

17:44.150 --> 17:45.340
A long ride?

17:45.340 --> 17:47.390
Yes. What do you think?

17:47.390 --> 17:49.550
There are some nice places around the capital.

17:50.140 --> 17:51.260
That sounds lovely!

17:51.570 --> 17:53.090
Then it's decided.

17:53.090 --> 17:56.060
I'll teach you how to ride 
a horse when you have time.

17:56.060 --> 17:57.970
You'll teach me?

17:58.450 --> 18:00.180
As long as you don't mind.

18:00.580 --> 18:04.900
Not at all! I'm really looking forward to it.

18:22.960 --> 18:25.710
<i>My work as the Holy Saint is done.</i>

18:26.410 --> 18:28.670
<i>It was over so fast...</i>

18:29.750 --> 18:32.130
<i>Without purifications and subjugations,</i>

18:32.420 --> 18:34.600
<i>what is left for me to do?</i>

18:42.580 --> 18:44.480
<i>To be frank, your engagement.</i>

18:47.980 --> 18:49.680
Oh, yeah.

18:49.680 --> 18:52.770
Social events. I have to 
participate in social events...

18:52.770 --> 18:57.350
I know, my kindred spirit.
I haven't forgotten.

18:59.380 --> 19:05.830
But, honestly, the idea of getting engaged 
and then married doesn't feel real to me.

19:06.530 --> 19:12.300
I just want to enjoy these 
fluttering feelings a little longer...

19:15.590 --> 19:17.380
I'm having so much fun right now.

19:19.400 --> 19:20.640
Okay!

19:20.640 --> 19:23.040
Let's not worry about troublesome things!

19:23.040 --> 19:25.020
Let's just think about fun stuff!

19:25.020 --> 19:29.030
So then, I'll continue my research as usual,

19:29.030 --> 19:31.730
but I'd like to spend 
more time on my hobbies...

19:31.730 --> 19:34.540
I want to keep up tea parties 
with Liz and Aira, too.

19:35.160 --> 19:36.770
Also...

19:40.130 --> 19:43.270
I'll have Commander Hawke 
teach me how to ride a horse

19:43.270 --> 19:45.120
when he's free back in the capital.

19:45.510 --> 19:48.250
We'll go on long rides after I learn.

19:48.250 --> 19:51.590
I can make sandwiches 
and we can have picnics.

19:51.970 --> 19:56.440
I'll make big ones stuffed 
with herbed roast chicken.

19:56.440 --> 19:58.670
I wonder if he'd like that.

19:59.870 --> 20:03.320
And not just picnics. We could also...

20:04.170 --> 20:05.270
Also what?

20:08.230 --> 20:10.270
Huh? What should I do?!

20:10.270 --> 20:12.690
This is bad! This is definitely bad!

20:26.480 --> 20:28.620
Oh, I see.

20:29.070 --> 20:30.900
So this is what falling in love feels like...

22:11.600 --> 22:14.480
Thank you for your incredible assistance.

22:14.910 --> 22:19.440
I-It was nothing. 
I'm grateful for all your hospitality.

22:19.800 --> 22:23.390
We'll be in the capital
 during the social season.

22:23.390 --> 22:26.660
Do come and see us.

22:26.660 --> 22:28.370
I certainly will.

22:28.710 --> 22:31.080
Al, make sure to visit sometimes.

22:31.080 --> 22:32.670
Understood.

22:32.670 --> 22:35.290
Please contact me when you're in the capital.

22:36.040 --> 22:39.180
<i>Their affectionate family banter 
makes me smile...</i>

22:43.540 --> 22:45.610
We'll be heading out now.

22:45.610 --> 22:47.180
Until we meet again.

22:47.640 --> 22:51.340
Truly, Lady Takanashi, thank you.

22:51.340 --> 22:55.200
I cannot wait to see you again 
in the royal capital.

22:55.200 --> 22:58.360
I feel the same way. Thank you so very much.

23:27.430 --> 23:32.270
<i>And so, my duties as the Holy Saint 
came to an end for the time being.</i>

23:34.980 --> 23:39.980
Next Time

23:34.980 --> 23:39.980
"Theatergoing"
